    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/7/72/Petraqbulb.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20240502034750\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Petraqbulb\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/7/72/Petraqbulb.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20240502034750\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"931\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Petraqbulb.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Petraqbulb.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p><p><b>森林妖精</b>\n</p><p>一位来自妖精部落的美丽战士，热爱花朵和森林。\n她离开了妖精村庄，因为她渴望成为一位人类的美丽战士。\n\n</p><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/4/4c/SPetraqbulb.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20240502034850\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"SPetraqbulb\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/4/4c/SPetraqbulb.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20240502034850\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"1036\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"SPetraqbulb.jpg\" data-image-key=\"SPetraqbulb.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/c/ce/Petra_WF_Relaxation_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20260504232519\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Petra WF Relaxation Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/c/ce/Petra_WF_Relaxation_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20260504232519\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"876\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Petra WF Relaxation Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Petra_WF_Relaxation_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jp